reverseFactors -- The isomorphism from F**G to G**F when F,G are complexes
**************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        phi = reverseFactors(F,G)
        phi = reverseFactors(M,N,p,q)
  * Inputs:
      * F, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, 
      * G, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, 
      * M, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, 
      * N, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, 
      * p, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * q, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * phi, a *note map of complexes: (Complexes)ComplexMap,, to G**F from
        F**G

Description
===========

maps F_{n-i}**G_i \to G_i**F_{n-i} changing the basis order and putting in sign
(-1)^{i*(n-i)}. In reverseFactors(M,N,p,q) the integers p and q specify the
homological degrees of M and N respectively.

+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = ZZ/101[a,b]                                                      |
|                                                                          |
|o1 = S                                                                    |
|                                                                          |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                       |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = complex{map(S^1,S^{-1},a)}                                       |
|                                                                          |
|      1      1                                                            |
|o2 = S  <-- S                                                             |
|                                                                          |
|     0      1                                                             |
|                                                                          |
|o2 : Complex                                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : G = complex{map(S^1,S^{-1},b)}[3]                                    |
|                                                                          |
|      1      1                                                            |
|o3 = S  <-- S                                                             |
|                                                                          |
|     -3     -2                                                            |
|                                                                          |
|o3 : Complex                                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : phi = reverseFactors(F,G)                                            |
|                                                                          |
|           1             1                                                |
|o4 = -3 : S  <--------- S  : -3                                           |
|                | 1 |                                                     |
|                                                                          |
|           2                    2                                         |
|     -2 : S  <---------------- S  : -2                                    |
|                {1} | 0 -1 |                                              |
|                {1} | 1 0  |                                              |
|                                                                          |
|           1                 1                                            |
|     -1 : S  <------------- S  : -1                                       |
|                {2} | 1 |                                                 |
|                                                                          |
|o4 : ComplexMap                                                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : G**F                                                                 |
|                                                                          |
|      1      2      1                                                     |
|o5 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                      |
|                                                                          |
|     -3     -2     -1                                                     |
|                                                                          |
|o5 : Complex                                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : F**G                                                                 |
|                                                                          |
|      1      2      1                                                     |
|o6 = S  <-- S  <-- S                                                      |
|                                                                          |
|     -3     -2     -1                                                     |
|                                                                          |
|o6 : Complex                                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : apply(1+length(F**G), i->(                                           |
|                 (phi_i)*((F**G).dd_(i+1)) ==  ((G**F).dd_(i+1))*phi_(i+1)|
|                 ))                                                       |
|                                                                          |
|o7 = {true, true, true}                                                   |
|                                                                          |
|o7 : List                                                                 |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : apply(length (F**G), i -> (rank phi_i) == rank ((F**G)_i))           |
|                                                                          |
|o8 = {true, true}                                                         |
|                                                                          |
|o8 : List                                                                 |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------+

